    :$ smth --no-base --config fraktur.toml --json --query target (exit: 0)

```stdout
[
  {
    "name": "target-with-limited-name-padding",
    "tmux": "target-with-limited-name-padding",
    "live": true,
    "deletable": false,
    "pending_deletion": false,
    "flagged": false,
    "tags": [
      "a",
      "b",
      "z"
    ]
  }
]
```

Fullwidth Latin glyphs occupy two cells each. Supply only fullwidth a to infer
the next 25 consecutive code points. Add d so the four glyphs cannot all fit
beside the name: the inline span contracts, while the footer shows all four.

    :$ -q smth --no-base --tag d target-with-limited-name-padding (exit: 0)
    :w wide.toml (written)

```toml
[ui]
tags = "ａ"
```

    :t new-session -d -s wide-ui "smth --no-base --config wide.toml; cat" (success)
    :t resize-window -t wide-ui:0 -x 100 -y 10 (success)
    :p wide-ui:0.0
    :settle -d 2s (settled)
    :k C-p target
    :snap

